Usage: ./build-cli/canbench-cli [options]
Simulated protocol regression on verified Linux vcan only.

Options:
  -h, --help                    Displays this help.
  --interface <name>            Verified vcan interface
  --output <directory>          New directory for result, raw log and engine
                                reports
  --case <name>                 normal|response-timeout|heartbeat-timeout|resta
                                rt|wrong-seq|late-response
  --duration-ms <milliseconds>  Observation duration (2300..30000 ms)
